OL,3,GNEWSADerby sets out Christmas programme
OL,4,Aof events
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerby is gearing up to celebrate the
OL,7,Fbeginning of the festive season with a
OL,8,Fprogramme of events.
OL,10,FThis year's Christmas lights switch-on
OL,11,Fwill be taking place on Saturday 28
OL,12,FNovember.
OL,14,FThe flicking of the festive switch will
OL,15,Ffollow a lantern parade and coincide
OL,16,Fwith the official opening of the city's
OL,17,Ftemporary ice rink.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
