OL,3,GNEWSADerby sets out Christmas programme
OL,4,Aof events
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerby City Council cabinet member for
OL,7,Fcity centre, culture and tourism
OL,8,FGurkiran Kaur, said: "Christmas is a
OL,9,Ftime for making memories with family
OL,10,Fand friends, and we're delighted to be
OL,11,Fbringing a fantastic programme of
OL,12,Ffestive events to Derby once again."
